<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong dlr, money quiet, outwatching US rates.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong dlr, money quiet, outwatching US rates.</headline>
<text>
<p>* Dealers said expecting big demand for upcoming spate of red chip IPOs as stock investors switch out of Hong Kong blue chips and into China-related stocks, hoping for China rate cut</p>
<p>* EFN yields: 3yr 6.71 pct, 5yr 7.18 pct, 7yr 7.39 pct, one week 5.26 pct</p>
<p>-- Sarah Davison (852) 2843 6470</p>
</text>
